      "content": "it’s just hard to talk to people about it. like, if i tell my partner or my friends, they'll just think i'm ungrateful. they'll say \"but you have such a great life\" and then i'll feel even more guilty for being miserable. it feels like i'm just performing being happy every single day. it's exhausting. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop where nothing matters and nothing ever will.",
